``` LF-01 | Daily License Usage by Index, Sourcetype, and Host vs. Quota
    Splunk Administrator Field Manual - Gaurav Malik

    Use case: Report daily license consumption against the pool quota and
    identify which indexes, sourcetypes, and hosts account for it.
    Run on: SH for usage, LM for the | rest quota join. If the join returns no
    quota_gb, the search head cannot reach the LM's REST endpoints. Run on the
    LM instead.
    Query: Top sourcetypes and hosts for yesterday (SH)
```
index=_internal source=*license_usage.log* type=Usage earliest=-1d@d latest=@d
| stats sum(b) as bytes by st h
| eval gb=round(bytes / 1024 / 1024 / 1024, 3)
| sort - bytes
| head 25
| table st h gb
